msgstr "Αποστολή…"

#: includes/class-tet-notify-settings.php:181 includes/class-tet-notify-settings.php:386
msgid "On"
msgstr "Ενεργό"

#: includes/class-tet-notify-settings.php:182 includes/class-tet-notify-settings.php:382
